neD">1.The Unaudited Standalone Financial Results of Garware Technical Fibres Limited the Company as well as Consolidated Financial Results of the Company and its Subsidiaries and its associates for the quarter ended 30th June 2025, were reviewed by the Audit Committee and have been taken on record and approved by the Board of Directors at its meeting held on Friday 08th August 2025. The Statutory Auditors of the Company have carried out a Limited Review of the Financial Statements for the quarter ended 30th June 2025. &lt;BR&gt; 
2.These results have been prepared in accordance with the Companies Indian Accounting Standards Rules, 2015 prescribed under Section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013 and other recognized practices and policies to the extent applicable. &lt;BR&gt; 
3.During the quarter, the Company incorporated a subsidiary named as Garware Technical Fibres AS.GTF AS in Norway with initial capital of INR 2.55 Lakhs I.e. Nok 30,000 comprising  30,000 shares of  Nok 1 each. &lt;BR&gt; 
On 25.06.2025, The Company contributed, assigned and transferred, all of its rights, title and interest in and to the Business Undertaking along with all its assets and liabilities in its Norway Branch i.e. Garware Technical Fibres NUF on a going concern basis to GTF AS. The Consideration for the same was discharged by GTF AS by issuance of its 100% paid up shares to the Company. The Accounts of GTF AS have been consolidated in the Consolidated Financial Statements of the Group. &lt;BR&gt; 
4.During the quarter, the Company has infused initial capital of INR 11.60 Lakhs I.e. GBP 10,000 comprising 10,000 shares of GBP 1 each into its wholly owned subsidiary in United Kingdom named as Garware Technical Fibres UK Pvt. Ltd.  &lt;BR&gt; 
Further, as on July 4, 2025, the Company has made further investment in GTF UK of INR 11160.52 Lakhs by way of subscription to 93,94,444 equity shares of GBP 1 each, for aggregate subscription value of GBP 93,94,444 on the understanding that the said investment shall be utilized by GTF UK principally for the acquisition of 100% of the issued equity share of Offshore and Trawl Supply AS and Advanced Mooring Supply AS. The Accounts of GTF UK have been consolidated in the Consolidated Financial Statements of the Group. &lt;BR&gt; 
5.During the quarter, Garware Technical Fibres UK Pvt. Ltd. wholly owned subsidiary of the Company has entered into definitive Share Purchase Agreement with the SellerS of Offshore and Trawl Supply AS and Advanced Mooring Supply AS, both private limited liability companies duly registered and validly existing under the laws of Norway for an aggregate acquisition value of NOK 122 Million. On 7th July 2025, GTF UK has successfully completed the acquisition of the said Norwegian Companies. Consequent to the acquisition as above, OTS and AMS have become wholly owned subsidiaries of GTF UK and consequently, step-down wholly owned subsidiaries of the Company. &lt;BR&gt; 
6.On 6th January, 2025, the Company had issued 7,94,12,676 fully paid-up Bonus Equity Shares of Rs. 10 each in the ratio of 4:1 to the eligible members of the Company by capitalizing Rs. 79,41,26,760 out of General Reserve of the Company. As a result of the bonus issue, the paid-up capital of the Company stands increased to Rs.992,658,000 from Rs. 198,532,000.  &lt;BR&gt; 
